    'a child and an alien putting helmet, map and snacks into labeled boxes, tidy shelves',
    'a tidy rocket cabin with a shiny helmet on a hook and a star map unrolled, the alien pointing',
    'a rocket flying through a sky full of stars and little planets, a child and an alien at the window',
    'a party on a small glowing planet with lanterns shaped like stars and tiny alien guests dancing',
